- STRICT CLIP DURATION BOUNDARY: The total clip duration is {{ clip_duration }}. ALL timestamp distractors (start and end) MUST be <= {{ clip_duration }} and strictly within 00:00 to {{ clip_duration }}.
- Each distractor MUST have NO OVERLAP with the ground truth range. Use a minimum gap of 2 seconds.
